@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmR2,ArmL5
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:魔法を成長させる術……<br>少女を殺して、魔女へと成長させるの。|#0103Trial09_Margo005| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_Common_1 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

